WEBVTT

01:59.640 --> 02:01.760
Is this the product you want to promote

02:01.840 --> 02:03.720
as the theme for the first physical store?

02:03.800 --> 02:05.560
A blush with rich colors?

02:07.840 --> 02:09.360
Colors are electromagnetic waves.

02:09.960 --> 02:11.000
Light with different wavelengths

02:11.080 --> 02:13.760
acts on the human visual organs,
producing color perception,

02:14.440 --> 02:16.640
which leads to corresponding
psychological activities,

02:16.720 --> 02:18.080
thereby affecting mood.

02:18.160 --> 02:19.480
TBC

02:19.560 --> 02:20.760
I hope

02:20.840 --> 02:23.120
that when customers open our product
in the morning,

02:23.200 --> 02:25.800
they will see colors
that make them feel happy.

02:26.400 --> 02:27.880
Though it's just a blush,

02:28.480 --> 02:30.560
when they use the product,

02:30.640 --> 02:33.720
it's like coloring a new day.

02:34.960 --> 02:36.680
These blushes are so beautiful.

02:36.760 --> 02:39.400
If they're displayed in a physical store
with proper lighting,

02:39.480 --> 02:41.480
they'll definitely catch
people's attention.

02:42.000 --> 02:43.560
It's indeed beautiful.

02:45.880 --> 02:47.440
What's this?

02:48.120 --> 02:48.960
It's Plum Dye.

02:49.040 --> 02:51.160
It's made with red plum blossoms,

02:51.240 --> 02:52.320
so it's called Plum Dye.

02:55.880 --> 02:58.240
In ancient books, tucao is bitter.

02:58.320 --> 03:00.000
Rubus rosifolius's flowers are white,

03:00.080 --> 03:01.080
so it's called Rubus White.

03:04.280 --> 03:05.280
What's this?

03:05.800 --> 03:08.720
It looks like the color of chestnuts
fallen to the ground in autumn,

03:08.800 --> 03:10.360
so it's called Falling Chestnut.

03:13.160 --> 03:15.000
Suo comes from sappanwood.

03:15.080 --> 03:17.080
It's a very important red dye,

03:17.160 --> 03:18.360
so it's called Suo.

03:21.440 --> 03:22.880
What does this mean?

03:23.440 --> 03:24.680
Pleased as persimmons?

03:25.560 --> 03:26.680
Light Persimmon.

03:26.760 --> 03:28.200
It comes from an ancient term.

03:33.520 --> 03:34.440
This…

03:35.080 --> 03:36.320
Is this a rhododendron?

03:36.920 --> 03:37.800
Azalea.

03:38.760 --> 03:41.680
Rhododendrons are also known as azaleas.

03:42.400 --> 03:44.320
Do you want to try it on your face?

03:51.640 --> 03:53.400
Only after using it yourself

03:53.480 --> 03:56.080
can you understand
the customer's feelings.

03:58.720 --> 04:00.920
OK, I'll try it on my face.

04:03.720 --> 04:05.480
When you put on the blush,

04:05.560 --> 04:08.880
the foundation plays a critical role.

04:08.960 --> 04:10.920
If you want to better understand
the product,

04:11.000 --> 04:14.120
it's best to apply full makeup first.

04:19.320 --> 04:22.360
If you don't understand the product,
you can't do well in marketing.

04:27.520 --> 04:30.120
OK, I'll wear my makeup.

04:30.200 --> 04:31.280
It's all for work.

04:38.920 --> 04:39.800
Mr. Gu.

04:43.880 --> 04:44.720
Could you leave us?

04:44.800 --> 04:46.840
I need to discuss something
with Mr. Tang and Su Chengcheng.

04:56.200 --> 04:57.320
What's going on?

05:02.480 --> 05:03.600
Su Chengcheng.

05:04.440 --> 05:05.720
I asked you to open the class group

05:05.800 --> 05:08.200
and watch the video file from Tang Qi.
Did you watch it?

05:09.080 --> 05:10.200
The video file?

05:13.240 --> 05:14.840
I watched it.

05:18.720 --> 05:21.400
What do you think
about the way Tang Qi treats you?

05:23.040 --> 05:26.200
Tang Qi is pretty good to me.

05:28.680 --> 05:30.120
He just suggested you do your makeup.

05:30.800 --> 05:32.160
Why were you so hesitant?

05:34.000 --> 05:37.160
I just don't want to wear makeup.

05:37.880 --> 05:39.080
Why don't you want to wear makeup?

05:39.160 --> 05:40.360
I…

05:44.440 --> 05:45.880
What do you think?

05:50.320 --> 05:52.440
Tang Qi, aren't you really smart?

05:52.520 --> 05:54.880
Why didn't you notice
your girlfriend's odd behavior?

05:59.880 --> 06:02.200
I ran into Su Chengcheng
at the hospital today.

06:07.200 --> 06:08.760
Why did you go to the hospital?

06:09.400 --> 06:10.560
Are you sick?

06:15.240 --> 06:17.080
I've never met anyone so clueless.

06:20.840 --> 06:21.920
Su Chengcheng…

06:24.040 --> 06:25.680
Su Chengcheng went to see an obstetrician.

06:33.440 --> 06:34.720
She's pregnant.

06:40.560 --> 06:41.760
You're pregnant?

06:42.360 --> 06:44.240
I'm pregnant?

06:50.160 --> 06:51.120
How did you get pregnant?

06:55.440 --> 06:58.640
Yeah. How did I get pregnant?

06:59.840 --> 07:00.840
Is it

07:01.800 --> 07:02.760
me?

07:04.280 --> 07:06.040
Tang Qi, how can you say that?

07:07.160 --> 07:09.560
Of course, it's you.

07:12.680 --> 07:15.080
Right, of course, it's you.

07:19.160 --> 07:20.040
Right.

07:21.640 --> 07:22.760
You can leave.

07:24.200 --> 07:25.480
I'll solve this

07:26.440 --> 07:27.400
with Chengcheng.

07:37.160 --> 07:38.000
Talk properly.

07:54.000 --> 07:55.520
So, Lin Yuan is pregnant,

07:55.600 --> 07:57.200
and you went with her
for the prenatal checkup?

07:57.280 --> 07:58.400
Yes.

07:59.280 --> 08:00.280
No, I…

08:04.080 --> 08:05.760
Lin Yuan is pregnant,

08:05.840 --> 08:07.720
and she doesn't want others to know,

08:08.320 --> 08:09.160
especially Gu Yu.

08:10.360 --> 08:11.240
Why?

08:15.920 --> 08:18.160
She hasn't decided
if she wants this child.

08:42.640 --> 08:44.800
Mr. Gu, I'll get back to work now.

09:11.600 --> 09:12.600
Tang,

09:12.680 --> 09:13.760
why the long face?

09:14.400 --> 09:16.160
Who are you mad at?

09:17.000 --> 09:18.760
Su Chengcheng is pregnant
but hasn't told you.

09:18.840 --> 09:19.960
You should reflect on yourself.

09:20.560 --> 09:21.960
Why didn't your girlfriend tell you
she's pregnant?

09:27.440 --> 09:28.680
It's a matter between the two of you,

09:28.760 --> 09:31.800
but she'd rather carry it alone
than tell you.

09:31.880 --> 09:33.040
What does this mean?

09:33.720 --> 09:36.200
It means your girlfriend
doesn't trust you.

09:37.120 --> 09:39.960
You should reflect on your actions.

09:40.520 --> 09:41.440
Have you been caring enough?

09:42.720 --> 09:44.120
Do you deserve her trust?

09:44.720 --> 09:45.560
Have you…

09:51.120 --> 09:53.080
Su Chengcheng

09:53.720 --> 09:55.360
still acts recklessly.

09:55.440 --> 09:57.480
Could it be
that she doesn't want this child?

09:59.480 --> 10:01.720
You… I…

10:03.600 --> 10:05.800
As your friend, this is all I can do.

10:05.880 --> 10:08.080
Next, you'll have to solve this yourself.

10:09.840 --> 10:11.920
- Gu Yu.
- What?

10:19.440 --> 10:21.080
I don't know what to do.

10:21.160 --> 10:22.480
What else can you do?

10:23.760 --> 10:25.520
Just get married and have the child.

10:31.720 --> 10:32.960
Tonight,

10:34.640 --> 10:35.520
go to see Lin Yuan

10:37.000 --> 10:39.560
and have a private, good,

10:40.680 --> 10:41.960
and patient conversation.

10:51.120 --> 10:51.960
Got it.

10:54.000 --> 10:56.000
You and Su Chengcheng need to talk, right?

10:56.080 --> 10:58.720
Don't worry. Lin Yuan and I
will never disturb you.

10:59.280 --> 11:00.360
Good luck.

11:08.280 --> 11:09.880
Time to leave.

11:10.520 --> 11:12.280
- Goodbye. Let's go.
- Bye-bye.

11:15.000 --> 11:16.920
- I'm leaving, Chengcheng. Bye-bye.
- Bye-bye.

11:20.120 --> 11:20.960
Mr. Tang.

11:33.040 --> 11:36.240
Sorry. I can't stay with you tonight.

11:36.320 --> 11:38.720
I had my dad cook some soup,
and I'm taking it to Lin Yuan

11:38.800 --> 11:39.960
to help her with some nutrition.

11:41.200 --> 11:43.440
Don't go. Let Gu Yu
take the soup to Lin Yuan.

11:43.520 --> 11:46.280
No, Gu Yu is too smart,
and he'll definitely guess that.

11:46.360 --> 11:47.880
If so, Lin Yuan would be mad at me.

11:49.000 --> 11:50.440
From my perspective,

11:50.520 --> 11:52.160
I should've told Gu Yu.

11:52.240 --> 11:53.160
No, you…

11:53.240 --> 11:54.600
But I promised you
I wouldn't say anything.

11:55.760 --> 11:57.560
You have to keep your word.

11:59.720 --> 12:00.880
Tonight,

12:01.920 --> 12:04.280
let's both do nothing

12:04.920 --> 12:07.920
and leave it to Gu Yu and Lin Yuan, okay?

12:37.040 --> 12:38.280
I bought the best ingredients.

12:38.360 --> 12:39.440
We'll have dinner at home tonight.

12:41.280 --> 12:43.120
Where are Chengcheng and Tang Qi?

12:43.200 --> 12:44.760
They have something to do,

12:44.840 --> 12:46.000
so they won't join us.

12:54.280 --> 12:57.160
Pan-seared steak
and avocado salad are quick dishes.

12:57.240 --> 12:58.280
It'll be done in half an hour.

13:13.880 --> 13:16.200
What do Chengcheng and Tang Qi need to do?

13:17.480 --> 13:19.440
Tang Qi knows Su Chengcheng is pregnant.

13:19.520 --> 13:21.000
Chengcheng is pregnant?

13:26.680 --> 13:28.240
That's their business.

13:28.320 --> 13:29.720
Don't worry about it.

13:29.800 --> 13:31.800
Let them handle it.

13:33.880 --> 13:35.760
I'm about to pan-sear the steak,
and there will be some smoke.

13:36.640 --> 13:38.280
Why don't you go upstairs for a while?

13:39.600 --> 13:41.320
- I…
- I'll take you up.

13:43.120 --> 13:44.880
This way, please.

13:46.520 --> 13:48.560
For the steak, how do you want it cooked?

13:48.640 --> 13:51.320
Medium, medium-well, or well-done?

14:32.480 --> 14:35.160
Yuan, dinner's ready.

14:39.240 --> 14:40.600
I'm driving home tonight,

14:40.680 --> 14:41.720
so I didn't prepare wine.

14:42.240 --> 14:43.160
OK.

14:52.240 --> 14:53.800
The soup Mr. Su made is really delicious.

14:55.440 --> 14:56.760
Uncle's cooking is really good.

14:57.640 --> 14:59.280
Then try my cooking.

15:04.800 --> 15:06.640
Here, have a shrimp.

15:23.920 --> 15:25.800
You have a good appetite tonight.

15:30.240 --> 15:32.560
I didn't have lunch, so I'm a bit hungry.

15:33.840 --> 15:35.280
Are you upset

15:35.800 --> 15:37.120
because you wanted to keep it a secret,

15:37.200 --> 15:40.280
but I told Tang Qi

15:40.360 --> 15:41.600
that Su Chengcheng is pregnant?

15:44.120 --> 15:45.400
Why did you do that?

15:48.520 --> 15:50.080
Being pregnant involves them both.

15:50.160 --> 15:53.240
I think Tang Qi has the right to know.

16:11.200 --> 16:13.840
This is Su Chengcheng and Tang Qi's issue.

16:14.720 --> 16:16.800
We don't need to get angry

16:17.400 --> 16:18.800
or argue over it.

16:18.880 --> 16:21.680
Anyway, this won't happen to us.

16:29.240 --> 16:31.200
I don't want to get married
or have kids right now.

16:31.280 --> 16:32.720
Can you really accept that?

16:45.680 --> 16:46.800
I only want you.

16:48.600 --> 16:50.400
But can your mom accept it

16:50.480 --> 16:53.640
if you never get married or have kids?

16:56.680 --> 16:58.040
This is my life,

16:58.120 --> 16:59.800
not my mom's life.

17:09.599 --> 17:10.440
Alright.

17:16.079 --> 17:20.400
If Su Chengcheng wants to get pregnant,
get married, and have kids,

17:20.480 --> 17:22.200
that's her life.

17:22.880 --> 17:23.720
You are you.

17:24.599 --> 17:27.640
There's no need to question yourself

17:27.720 --> 17:29.800
or doubt me because of her.

17:32.320 --> 17:34.160
We have our own lives.

17:42.400 --> 17:43.680
Maybe

17:44.640 --> 17:48.440
they'll be a little different
from most people's lives,

17:49.400 --> 17:53.680
but we'll still live
fulfilling and happy lives.

18:35.720 --> 18:37.640
I don't know what's wrong with my mom.

18:37.720 --> 18:39.440
She suddenly called me home

18:39.520 --> 18:40.880
and insisted I bring you along.

18:42.320 --> 18:43.840
There's a misunderstanding between us.

18:43.920 --> 18:45.040
We can clear that up.

18:45.600 --> 18:46.880
What misunderstanding?

18:48.720 --> 18:49.960
Let's go upstairs first.

19:07.040 --> 19:08.760
Dad, Mom,

19:08.840 --> 19:10.480
feel free to say it if you want to.

19:10.560 --> 19:12.360
Why are you staring at us like this?

19:13.800 --> 19:16.360
Go ahead. When are you getting married?

19:18.320 --> 19:19.160
Getting married?

19:21.880 --> 19:23.520
I've checked the dates.

19:23.600 --> 19:26.840
There's a good day for marriage next week.

19:28.760 --> 19:31.600
Didn't you always say I was young
and not in a hurry?

19:31.680 --> 19:33.320
Why the sudden rush for me to get married?

19:33.400 --> 19:35.120
We're not in a hurry,

19:35.640 --> 19:37.320
but can that child wait?

19:38.320 --> 19:39.280
Child?

19:40.080 --> 19:41.080
What child?

19:50.480 --> 19:53.480
Do you think I'm pregnant?

19:54.000 --> 19:56.000
You misunderstood. I'm not.

19:56.080 --> 19:57.560
You still won't admit it, huh?

19:57.640 --> 19:59.400
Your sister heard it.

19:59.480 --> 20:01.280
Do you still want to hide it from us?

20:01.360 --> 20:03.080
It's really not me.

20:03.160 --> 20:04.160
Not you?

20:06.840 --> 20:08.040
Chengcheng isn't pregnant.

20:09.760 --> 20:11.320
Who's pregnant then?

20:12.400 --> 20:13.240
Who is it?

20:16.360 --> 20:17.280
Who?

20:35.640 --> 20:37.000
Uncle, Aunt.

20:43.920 --> 20:45.000
It's Lin Yuan.

20:47.400 --> 20:49.360
Lin Yuan isn't sure what to do.

20:49.440 --> 20:50.920
She asked Chengcheng to keep it a secret.

20:51.000 --> 20:54.680
But accidentally, Gu Yu
misunderstood it, thinking

20:56.160 --> 20:57.640
Chengcheng was pregnant with my child.

20:59.680 --> 21:02.600
It's not Chengcheng. It's Yuan.

21:02.680 --> 21:04.120
Yuan?

21:04.200 --> 21:05.360
That's more serious.

21:05.440 --> 21:07.880
Call her and have her come over.

21:07.960 --> 21:09.960
Otherwise, she'll make a fuss.

21:10.040 --> 21:11.280
Dad, Dad.

21:11.360 --> 21:12.440
No need to call her.

21:12.520 --> 21:13.400
Let's go there

21:13.480 --> 21:15.640
and talk everything through face-to-face.

21:15.720 --> 21:17.120
- Mom.
- What's wrong?

21:17.200 --> 21:19.000
Don't be impulsive. Let's talk slowly.

21:19.080 --> 21:22.960
Usually, what you and Yuan do
is between you two.

21:23.040 --> 21:24.560
Your dad and I don't get involved.

21:24.640 --> 21:26.440
Now, this is between me and Yuan.

21:26.520 --> 21:29.280
I'm her mother,
so you shouldn't get involved.

21:29.360 --> 21:30.560
Dad.

21:30.640 --> 21:32.600
You can't go like this.
Gu Yu doesn't know yet.

21:32.680 --> 21:34.680
Then we'll clear things up.

21:35.200 --> 21:37.760
You've always told us about boundaries.

21:37.840 --> 21:40.360
Now, you need to have some boundaries too.

21:40.440 --> 21:41.640
Don't interfere in our matters.

21:42.240 --> 21:44.320
I… Sis…

21:45.680 --> 21:47.920
Look at them.
Do you think I can stop them?

21:51.080 --> 21:52.400
Dad! Mom!

22:07.560 --> 22:08.400
Here.

22:16.320 --> 22:17.160
Don't move.

22:19.360 --> 22:20.680
Did you get hurt?

22:23.240 --> 22:24.200
Stand still.

22:40.880 --> 22:42.160
Hold onto my shoulder.

22:43.320 --> 22:44.360
Left foot.

22:52.760 --> 22:53.680
Right foot.

23:06.440 --> 23:08.000
Alright, you can move now.

23:08.600 --> 23:10.160
Sit on the sofa for a while.

24:11.680 --> 24:12.680
Gu Yu,

24:16.040 --> 24:16.920
I'm pregnant.

24:19.800 --> 24:21.920
It's not Chengcheng. It's me.

24:22.840 --> 24:25.000
She just accompanied me for my checkup.

24:25.080 --> 24:26.520
The doctor said everything was fine.

24:40.320 --> 24:41.480
Sorry.

24:43.160 --> 24:46.200
I didn't know how to tell you.

24:48.400 --> 24:49.240
I…

24:50.920 --> 24:52.000
I don't know.

24:53.120 --> 24:55.240
If you're angry, I totally understand.

25:00.440 --> 25:01.640
You should reflect on yourself.

25:01.720 --> 25:03.440
Why didn't your girlfriend tell you
she's pregnant?

25:03.520 --> 25:05.360
It's a matter between the two of you,

25:05.440 --> 25:08.840
but she'd rather carry it alone
than tell you. What does this mean?

25:08.920 --> 25:11.160
It means your girlfriend
doesn't trust you.

25:11.760 --> 25:14.120
You should reflect on your actions.

25:14.800 --> 25:16.240
Have you been caring enough?

25:17.000 --> 25:18.400
Do you deserve her trust?

26:06.400 --> 26:07.880
It's okay.

26:08.720 --> 26:10.680
You've told me now.

26:26.520 --> 26:28.720
I don't feel confident about being a mom,

26:30.920 --> 26:32.920
and I don't know how to raise a child.

26:36.560 --> 26:37.800
I'm so scared.

26:43.160 --> 26:44.400
I'm scared too.

26:47.960 --> 26:50.600
I'm scared
that I haven't done well enough,

26:52.320 --> 26:53.680
so you don't trust me enough.

26:54.480 --> 26:58.200
I'm scared that I'll disappoint you.

26:59.880 --> 27:02.760
I'm scared that after some time,

27:03.840 --> 27:05.200
you'll get tired of me.

27:10.800 --> 27:12.320
But up until today,

27:18.160 --> 27:19.320
haven't we been getting along

27:21.160 --> 27:22.680
pretty well?

27:31.520 --> 27:35.400
Did you like the steak I made tonight?

27:39.160 --> 27:42.360
Will you still be my girlfriend tomorrow?

27:45.880 --> 27:48.760
Will you still be my girlfriend
the day after tomorrow?

28:07.920 --> 28:11.200
If you don't have confidence
about the future,

28:12.200 --> 28:13.800
then let's not consider the future.

28:15.080 --> 28:16.520
Let's just focus on the present.

28:17.640 --> 28:21.560
Tomorrow, let's live like today.

28:21.640 --> 28:24.720
The day after tomorrow,
let's live like tomorrow.

28:25.920 --> 28:28.200
Let's take it one day at a time.

28:28.880 --> 28:32.240
We'll leave the future
to decide when it comes.

28:46.600 --> 28:51.240
CHENGCHENG'S MOM

28:55.120 --> 28:56.160
Everything looks fine.

28:56.240 --> 28:58.200
Why does it say
the tire pressure is wrong?

28:59.120 --> 29:00.760
I've been too busy with work

29:00.840 --> 29:02.920
to have time for maintenance in a while.

29:04.120 --> 29:06.120
Safety is the top priority.

29:06.200 --> 29:07.040
You can't let this happen again.

29:07.120 --> 29:08.920
Got it, Dad. It won't happen next time.

29:09.600 --> 29:11.920
Why won't Yuan pick up the phone?

29:12.000 --> 29:14.080
I just sent a WeChat message to Chengcheng

29:14.160 --> 29:15.440
to have her tell Lin Yuan

29:15.520 --> 29:17.400
to come home tomorrow or the day after.

29:19.280 --> 29:20.680
Can we leave now, Su?

29:21.440 --> 29:22.280
Alright.

29:24.680 --> 29:26.480
Mom, it's already nine.

29:26.560 --> 29:28.920
With this car problem,
I can't drive too fast.

29:29.000 --> 29:31.120
It'll be late when we arrive
at Lin Yuan's place.

29:31.200 --> 29:33.320
Pregnant women shouldn't stay up too late.

29:34.600 --> 29:37.200
Right, safety first.

29:39.720 --> 29:41.440
Fine, let's head home.

29:41.520 --> 29:42.680
Alright.

29:42.760 --> 29:43.920
Dad, get in the car.

29:48.040 --> 29:49.280
I'll take Mom and Dad home.

29:49.360 --> 29:51.040
You and Lin Yuan owe me a favor.

29:55.400 --> 29:57.960
Thanks to my sister
at this critical moment.

30:01.280 --> 30:03.040
Something's wrong
with your sister's tires?

30:03.120 --> 30:04.360
Shall we go pick them up?

30:04.440 --> 30:06.600
My sister is very careful with her life.

30:06.680 --> 30:09.040
How could she make such a simple mistake?

30:09.120 --> 30:10.960
She's already had it checked.

30:11.040 --> 30:12.360
They said it was a false alarm.

30:12.440 --> 30:14.560
The car's onboard computer had a glitch,

30:14.640 --> 30:16.360
and the tire was actually fine.

30:16.960 --> 30:19.600
We've scheduled a repair
for this weekend to clear the glitch,

30:19.680 --> 30:22.040
but this happened tonight,

30:22.120 --> 30:23.840
so she cleverly made use of it.

30:26.880 --> 30:28.000
That's good.

30:29.480 --> 30:31.760
You didn't eat much for dinner.
Are you hungry?

30:31.840 --> 30:33.200
Yes.

30:33.800 --> 30:35.720
Come to my place.
I'll make you some wonton.

30:35.800 --> 30:37.040
OK.

30:41.280 --> 30:43.560
Gu Yu asked me to check the class group

30:43.640 --> 30:46.160
and said you posted a video.

30:46.760 --> 30:47.960
EXPERIMENTAL MIDDLE SCHOOL
ALUMNI ASSOCIATION

30:48.960 --> 30:51.920
If the edges of the image shrink inward,
forming a pillow shape,

30:52.000 --> 30:53.480
it's called pillow distortion.

30:53.560 --> 30:57.040
If the edges of the image bulge outward,
forming a barrel shape,

30:57.120 --> 30:58.640
it's called barrel distortion.

30:58.720 --> 31:01.760
The focal length of the human eye
is about 50 mm.

31:01.840 --> 31:04.040
If we treat the human eye as the standard,

31:04.120 --> 31:06.920
the most standard
shooting focal length is 50 mm.

31:07.000 --> 31:09.560
However, the common focal lengths
for front-facing cameras

31:09.640 --> 31:11.720
are 24 mm and 28 mm,

31:11.800 --> 31:13.800
which are shorter
than the human eye's focal length,

31:13.880 --> 31:15.400
so the images are severely distorted.

31:15.480 --> 31:17.960
As for the rear-facing cameras,
it's hard for non-professionals

31:18.040 --> 31:20.080
to control composition
and distance accurately,

31:20.160 --> 31:22.280
so it'd still lead
to different levels of distortion

31:22.360 --> 31:24.280
due to deviation
from the 50 mm focal length.

31:24.360 --> 31:27.360
From an optical perspective,
moderate retouching

31:27.440 --> 31:29.640
only restores
what the human eye truly sees,

31:29.720 --> 31:31.120
so it's not falsification.

31:31.200 --> 31:33.600
So, this is why
I don't look good in photos.

31:34.440 --> 31:35.920
No wonder I always think

31:36.000 --> 31:38.760
I look uglier in photos
than in the mirror.

31:38.840 --> 31:40.480
So, it's not just an illusion,

31:40.560 --> 31:41.480
and it has scientific backing.

31:43.680 --> 31:47.840
So, if you want to edit a photo, go ahead.

31:47.920 --> 31:49.200
If you don't want to, don't.

31:50.240 --> 31:51.960
Since this technology was invented,

31:52.040 --> 31:54.040
it's meant to be used.

32:05.560 --> 32:06.600
I know

32:06.680 --> 32:09.200
you're trying to avoid filters now

32:09.280 --> 32:10.920
after the filter bracelet incident,

32:11.520 --> 32:13.480
and you even refuse to wear makeup.

32:14.800 --> 32:17.120
But technologies aren't wrong.

32:17.680 --> 32:19.200
What's wrong is overusing them.

32:20.360 --> 32:22.800
As long as you know the limits
and use them properly,

32:23.440 --> 32:24.880
the progress of science and technology

32:24.960 --> 32:26.560
is ultimately for the benefit of humans.

32:32.960 --> 32:34.040
When we get home,

32:34.120 --> 32:36.320
I want to show you another video I made.

32:37.840 --> 32:39.040
What video?

32:39.120 --> 32:40.080
What's it about?

32:43.480 --> 32:46.360
Squids and octopuses
are cephalopods among mollusks,

32:46.880 --> 32:50.440
meaning their legs
are attached to their heads.

32:51.120 --> 32:53.400
The difference
is that octopuses have eight legs,

32:53.480 --> 32:55.840
while squids,
in addition to the eight legs,

32:55.920 --> 32:58.640
also have two very long tentacles.

32:58.720 --> 33:00.720
So, they look like
they have ten legs sometimes.

33:00.800 --> 33:02.240
Both squids and octopuses

33:02.320 --> 33:04.320
are very ferocious predators.

33:04.400 --> 33:05.960
They can prey on fish, shellfish,

33:06.040 --> 33:07.800
and shrimp that are smaller than them.

33:08.600 --> 33:10.440
The most amazing part

33:10.520 --> 33:13.680
is that squids and octopuses
can change color and shape.

33:13.760 --> 33:16.720
Look. This octopus was originally black,

33:17.320 --> 33:18.840
but it can instantly change its color

33:18.920 --> 33:21.560
and blend perfectly
with the coral reef behind it.

33:25.920 --> 33:28.800
There's an octopus hidden
in each of the four pictures.

33:29.640 --> 33:30.800
Can you find it?

33:39.120 --> 33:41.640
I can't tell. Where is it?

33:52.920 --> 33:55.440
Compared to them, chameleons are too weak.

33:57.080 --> 34:00.680
Squids and octopuses
can change shape to hide.

34:00.760 --> 34:03.080
They can also change color
to communicate with their kind,

34:03.160 --> 34:04.280
scare off enemies,

34:04.360 --> 34:06.920
and even mimic other animals.

34:10.440 --> 34:13.400
This mimic octopus gathers all its legs

34:13.480 --> 34:14.880
and pretends to be a flounder.

34:16.719 --> 34:18.719
That one is acting

34:18.800 --> 34:21.159
like a venomous lionfish.

34:21.840 --> 34:23.080
And this one

34:23.679 --> 34:26.920
hides in a hole
and only sticks out its two hands,

34:27.000 --> 34:28.440
pretending to be a sea snake.

34:29.000 --> 34:31.159
As it turns out, the mimic octopus

34:31.239 --> 34:33.840
is the world's greatest actor.

34:34.440 --> 34:36.960
If all the disguises are uncovered,

34:37.840 --> 34:39.760
they have one last trick to escape.

34:40.760 --> 34:42.239
What is it?

34:42.320 --> 34:43.960
Squids spit ink to escape.

34:44.800 --> 34:47.400
The ink blob they spit
is about the same size as their body.

34:48.440 --> 34:49.679
At the same time,

34:50.239 --> 34:52.080
they make themselves
completely transparent

34:52.159 --> 34:53.760
and escape in the opposite direction,

34:53.840 --> 34:55.360
so you can't see them.

34:56.880 --> 34:58.920
Squids can also disappear invisibly.

35:14.120 --> 35:15.840
I always thought

35:16.360 --> 35:17.680
the filter bracelet
didn't make you invisible

35:17.760 --> 35:19.200
to punish you.

35:22.800 --> 35:25.120
Squid can spit out ink
and become transparent.

35:25.200 --> 35:28.440
Do you think the evolution of this skill

35:28.960 --> 35:30.400
is a punishment

35:31.120 --> 35:32.320
or a reward?

35:34.680 --> 35:36.560
It's just for survival.

35:38.000 --> 35:38.840
Yes.

35:42.680 --> 35:46.200
Invisibility isn't a punishment

35:46.800 --> 35:47.880
and nor is it a reward.

35:50.680 --> 35:54.440
Are you saying I'm over-interpreting it?

35:56.920 --> 35:59.840
The wind didn't move and nor did the flag.

36:00.560 --> 36:02.080
It was the heart of the wise that moved.

36:04.040 --> 36:04.880
I don't understand.

36:08.920 --> 36:11.360
The advancement of science is not wrong.

36:12.040 --> 36:13.880
We shouldn't overuse filters

36:13.960 --> 36:16.720
to do illegal things or harm others.

36:17.400 --> 36:18.320
But it's perfectly fine

36:18.400 --> 36:20.680
to use filters to modify yourself.

36:26.080 --> 36:27.360
Just like makeup.

36:28.360 --> 36:31.040
Maybe you just want to please yourself.

36:32.000 --> 36:36.120
Maybe you want
to attract someone you like.

36:37.080 --> 36:40.600
Maybe you want to boost your confidence.

36:42.360 --> 36:44.200
Maybe you want to intimidate your enemies.

36:45.080 --> 36:46.400
No matter the reason,

36:47.360 --> 36:49.520
makeup itself is not wrong.

